  "details": "This broke worlds that depend on this API, making them completely unplayable since this throws a \"Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\" exception and halts the executing Udon component.\n\nNote that this is only affecting VR users only.\n\nThe error is originating from inside the setter of \"VRCCameraSettings.CullingMask\":\n\n'VRCSDK3RenderingVRCCameraSettings.__set_CullingMask__UnityEngineLayerMask__SystemVoid",
